hook hands\u2014a symbol of the power of dialogue and compromise. The bill, now amended to reflect a balanced perspective, was set to pass, marking a significant milestone in the nation\u2019s legislative history.\n\nIn that heated debate, the Sikh and Jewish politicians had not only navigated the treacherous waters of political dissent but had also demonstrated that even the most passionate disagreements could be bridged by empathy, respect, and a shared dedication to the common good."}
